==Spanish==
{{wikipedia|lang=es}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|es|la|calōrem}}, singular accusative of {{m|la|calor||heat, warmth}}. Compare French {{m|fr|chaleur}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{es-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|oɾ|lang=es}}

===Noun===
{{es-noun|m|es}}

# {{label|es|weather|energy}} [[heat]]
#: ''Tengo '''calor'''.''
#:: ''I'm hot. (lit. I have '''heat''').''
#: ''Hace '''calor'''.''
#:: ''It's hot. (lit. it makes '''heat''').''

